                            <span style="background:#ede9fe;color:#4f46e5;padding:.3rem .9rem;border-radius:20px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;">✓ Lab Komputer</span>
                            <span style="background:#ede9fe;color:#4f46e5;padding:.3rem .9rem;border-radius:20px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;">✓ Perpustakaan</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 reveal reveal-delay-3">
                    <div class="feature-card feature-card-amber">
                        <div class="feature-icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(245,158,11,0.35);">
                            <i class="fas fa-trophy" style="color:white;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="feature-title">Prestasi Gemilang</h3>
                        <p class="feature-desc">Meraih berbagai prestasi di tingkat regional dan nasional dalam bidang akademik maupun non-akademik.</p>
